          "answer": "Honestly, I think it would open up a lot of new experiences for me. Traveling to Italy would be different—I could dive into the culture more, interact with locals, and explore without feeling lost. Plus, it’d give me confidence in my career too, maybe even lead to opportunities where language skills are a plus. I just see it as a way to enhance my life overall, making everything feel richer and more connected."
